    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Property Team Lappin Estates take great pleasure in presenting 615 Carnlough Road, a 1950’s built 2-bedroom mid terrace “parlour house” set in a convenient part of Cabra a few minutes from Phibsborough, Stoneybatter, Phoenix Park and within walking distance of the city centre. This property has not been lived in for 3 years and avails of the Vacant Property Grant. \r\nIdeally set within a mature and favoured residential part of Cabra just minutes from Phibsborough, close to schools, shops, TU Grangegorman and with excellent links to public transport including LUAS Cross City and Bus Connect. \r\nPresented to the market in need of renovation, this family home is full of charm and offers the new owners an excellent opportunity to stamp their own mark and live in this most popular cityside location. \r\nThe accommodation briefly comprises parlour room, living room, kitchen, 2 bedrooms and a bathroom. Garden to the front and south facing rear garden.\r\nViewing is very highly recommended!"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall\t\t\r\nParlour Room\t3.00m x 3.00m\t\r\nLiving Room\t4.85m x 3.37m\tFireplace with gas fire insert.\r\nKitchen\t2.95m x 1.90m\tDoor to the garden\r\nUpstairs\r\nLanding\t\t\r\nWith attic access\r\nBedroom 1)\t3.80m x 3.95m\t\r\nBedroom 2)\t3.15m x 2.80m\t\r\nBathroom\t\tWC, whb and bath\r\n\r\nOutside\t\tGarden to the front and south facing rear garden.\r\n\r\nNegotiator:\tPaul Lappin Office:  01 8825730    \r\n\r\nViewing:\tViewing by appointment with Property Team Lappin Estates"
      },
